  { q: "Can the Halloween Bear be upgraded to a collectible?", a: "As of October 31, 2026, no upgrade has been announced for this gift. Telegram may add one later, but that isn't guaranteed." },
  { q: "Are the Halloween Bear and Mask the same?", a: "No. The Halloween Bear is a new 50-Star gift. Mask is a 2025 Halloween gift whose upgrades opened on October 31, 2026. Mask isn't on primary sale, so you can only get it from existing owners." },
  { q: "What if the gift doesn't arrive?", a: "If an order fails for a technical reason, send your payment receipt to @StarsjoySupport within 24 hours and you'll get a full refund." }
