    <p class="post-lead"><strong>Short answer:</strong> the Halloween Bear is a new Telegram gift released overnight on October 31, 2026, priced at <strong>50 Stars</strong>. In Uzbekistan, you can get it from the <a href="https://telegram.me/starsjoybot" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@starsjoybot</a> Mini App <strong>for 13,000 UZS with Uzcard or Humo</strong>: you only need a username, and it usually arrives in about 10 seconds. Telegram hasn't announced when sales end.</p>
  </section>

