    </div>
    <p>Prices and status are as of 2026-10-31. In its first 14 hours, <strong>67,930</strong> bears were sold, or about 81 gifts a minute (count by the <a href="https://t.me/podarokdurova/8030" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">Podarok Durova</a> channel).</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Where is the Halloween Bear available?</h2>
    <p>The Halloween Bear is available in Telegram's gift catalog and in the StarsJoy Mini App. The right route depends on your Stars balance and your card:</p>
    <div class="post-table-wrap">
      <table class="post-table">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Where</th><th>Price</th><th>What you need</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>StarsJoy Mini App</strong></td><td>13,000 UZS</td><td>Uzcard or Humo, a username</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Telegram catalog</td><td>50 Stars</td><td>50 Stars in your balance</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Gift Marketplace</td><td>Not available</td><td>The market is for collectibles only</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p>Other bots may offer it too, but check that they're trustworthy before paying. Here's how: <a href="/en/blog/is-buying-telegram-stars-safe">is buying Telegram Stars safe</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
