    <p>You don't need a Stars balance: you pay in Uzbek som and the gift goes straight to the recipient.</p>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Open the Mini App.</strong> Go to <a href="https://telegram.me/starsjoybot" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@starsjoybot</a> and choose the Gift section.</li>
      <li><strong>Enter the recipient.</strong> Type a friend's username or your own.</li>
      <li><strong>Pick the gift.</strong> Tap the 50-Star pumpkin bear. You can add a message or send it anonymously.</li>
      <li><strong>Pay.</strong> Transfer the exact amount to the card the bot shows, via Payme, Click or a banking app.</li>
      <li><strong>Receive it.</strong> The gift usually arrives in about 10 seconds. Under the public offer, orders are fulfilled within 5 minutes.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>The amount in the bot may be a few hundred UZS below 13,000. That's how the payment is matched to your order, so send it exactly as shown. If the recipient has closed messages in their profile, the gift won't go through.</p>
    <p><strong>Don't wait for sales to end.</strong> <a href="https://telegram.me/starsjoybot" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open @starsjoybot</a> and send the Halloween Bear for 13,000 UZS.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>How do I send the Halloween Bear in the Telegram app?</h2>
    <p>If you have 50 Stars in your balance, you can do it in Telegram itself:</p>
    <ol>
      <li>Open the recipient's profile.</li>
      <li>In the ⋮ or ⋯ menu at the top, choose <strong>Send a Gift</strong>.</li>
      <li>Find the Halloween Bear in the catalog.</li>
      <li>Add a message or hide your name, then pay 50 Stars.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>If you're short of Stars, <a href="/en/stars">buy them from StarsJoy with Uzcard or Humo</a>. The minimum is 50 Stars, which is 12,000 UZS.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
